  generalInfo: "Sin\xFCzit, sin\xFCs bo\u015Fluklar\u0131n\u0131n iltihaplanmas\u0131yla
    geli\u015Fen bir \xFCst solunum yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r. Hastalarda
    y\xFCz bas\u0131nc\u0131, burun t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ve ba\u015F
    a\u011Fr\u0131s\u0131 g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Burun t\u0131kan\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131, hafif burun ak\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131,
    hafif y\xFCz bas\u0131nc\u0131 var olmas\u0131 ve hafif ate\u015F sin\xFCzitte
    s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda kuru \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk
    var olabilir."
